# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PLAINTEXT VE EXAM SCRIPTS — NEVER COMMIT THESE
#
# This repository is a PUBLIC fork of parctesting/beta. Two GitHub behaviours
# make committing plaintext here permanent and unfixable:
#
#   1. "You cannot change the visibility of a fork by itself" — this repo cannot
#      be made private while its upstream is public.
#   2. "Commits can remain accessible in the repository network even after a
#      fork is deleted" — anything pushed here stays retrievable by SHA through
#      parctesting/beta forever. Deleting the fork or force-pushing does not
#      remove it.
#
# Only the ENCRYPTED output belongs in git: pages/*.html and ve/files/*.enc.
# Keep the plaintext sources in a separate PRIVATE repo (private repos are free;
# they simply cannot serve GitHub Pages).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
